WEBVTT

00:13:59.376 --> 00:14:05.632
it has been elevated above all else
to justify our current model.

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:09.011
This is a model built ...

00:14:09.595 --> 00:14:11.555
without vision,

00:14:11.597 --> 00:14:16.810
meant to, reluctantly,
provide women a small place.

00:14:18.145 --> 00:14:19.313
But never ...

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:21.899
not really, a chance.

00:14:22.816 --> 00:14:23.984
Thank you.

00:14:24.026 --> 00:14:26.486
(Cheers and applause)